WEBVTT

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:26.540
I activate Junk Archer's effect!

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:29.770
I remove Phoenixian Cluster 
Amaryllis from the game!

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:31.340
Dimension Shoot!

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:36.450
Here I go, Aki!  I attack you directly!

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:45.610
Aki, don't use force to control your D-Wheel!

00:00:45.610 --> 00:00:47.770
Trust your D-Wheel more!

00:00:47.770 --> 00:00:48.470
Okay!

00:01:03.210 --> 00:01:06.680
Aki is totally into Riding Duels.

00:01:06.680 --> 00:01:07.390
Yeah.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:12.550
I also want to do Riding Duels.

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:15.160
Lua doing Riding Duels?

00:01:16.550 --> 00:01:18.560
That won't look good!

00:01:18.950 --> 00:01:21.930
You don't have to laugh!

00:01:22.410 --> 00:01:26.870
Someday, I'm going to challenge 
Yusei and Jack in a Riding Duel!

00:01:44.930 --> 00:01:50.070
Every time you're hurt, you can become kinder

00:01:50.430 --> 00:01:55.600
Stand up and you'll understand strength

00:01:55.940 --> 00:02:00.080
Don't look back and keep going

00:02:00.310 --> 00:02:05.910
Both the past and the future 
are connected to the present

00:02:06.080 --> 00:02:10.890
There's no need to fear

00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:18.560
I'll keep telling you that you're not alone

00:02:19.630 --> 00:02:24.570
The passionate emotions in your heart

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:30.340
Streak to the infinite future

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:35.740
Dreams surpass their limits

00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:43.850
And will lead you to a bright place

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:16.460
Super Elite Transfer Student Arrives!

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:22.400
How boring.

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:27.690
Since it was a duel between Signers, 
I thought the Circuit would activate.

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:31.060
There still isn't enough power.

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:33.040
But we don't need to be impatient.

00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:36.450
Once the WRGP starts, everything will happen.

00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:40.940
Due to the WRGP, all 
circuits will be completed.

00:03:40.940 --> 00:03:47.140
Then the infinite power that we desire 
will be released and envelop the world!

00:03:47.140 --> 00:03:49.140
Will it be that easy?

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:55.170
I hope you haven't forgotten 
about the Crimson Dragon.

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:59.890
Godwin's plan failed because 
of the Crimson Dragon.

00:03:59.890 --> 00:04:04.090
As long as it exists, I don't think 
our plan will easily succeed.

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:06.090
What are you trying to say?

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:08.330
I'll defeat him.

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:11.950
I'll defeat him and take Stardust Dragon.

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:17.030
If I take Stardust, the Crimson Dragon 
can't interfere with our plan.

00:04:17.030 --> 00:04:19.400
Placido is going to defeat him?

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:21.550
You know you won't succeed.

00:04:22.010 --> 00:04:23.310
What?

00:04:23.520 --> 00:04:24.510
It's here!

00:04:30.090 --> 00:04:31.750
It's my stone tablet!

00:04:31.930 --> 00:04:33.380
Just what I was waiting for!

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:36.530
It means Placido can't succeed on his own.

00:04:42.150 --> 00:04:43.360
What's that?

00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:44.360
It's another meteor!

00:04:44.360 --> 00:04:45.360
It's huge!

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:46.320
Wow!

00:05:00.620 --> 00:05:02.680
What?  A giant meteor?

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:05.200
Yeah.  It's causing a huge commotion.

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:07.720
So the meteor caused the recent earthquake.

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:12.060
Ghost appeared right after 
the previous meteor landed.

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:14.260
Then this time...

00:05:14.260 --> 00:05:16.630
It might be foreshadowing something.

00:05:16.810 --> 00:05:19.620
Then let's check it out!

00:05:25.490 --> 00:05:27.890
Can it be?

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:30.630
Any further is off-limits.

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:32.610
What about the meteor?

00:05:32.610 --> 00:05:35.540
Security already took care of it.

00:05:35.540 --> 00:05:37.010
Oh no!

00:05:37.210 --> 00:05:39.540
We're too late.

00:05:39.930 --> 00:05:41.020
Yusei.

00:05:43.240 --> 00:05:45.520
I feel uneasy.

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:48.790
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:52.760
Good morning!

00:05:52.760 --> 00:05:56.410
I'd like you to meet your new friend today.

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:57.730
Come in.

00:06:00.200 --> 00:06:03.150
Luciano just transferred today.

00:06:03.890 --> 00:06:06.700
I'm Luciano.  Nice to meet you.

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:08.350
He's cute!

00:06:08.350 --> 00:06:09.690
He's wonderful!

00:06:14.710 --> 00:06:17.390
He's creepy.

00:06:17.590 --> 00:06:23.760
You heard about Duel Academy East 
School's Juvenile Grand Prix, right?

00:06:23.760 --> 00:06:24.570
Yes!

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:28.290
They say it's even hard to 
qualify for the tournament!

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:33.040
Yes.  Luciano won that tournament.

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:35.040
Won?

00:06:36.180 --> 00:06:40.970
If you have any questions, 
feel free to ask Luciano.

00:06:40.970 --> 00:06:43.050
You may learn some things!

00:06:43.050 --> 00:06:44.880
Okay!

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:46.980
He seems nice.

00:06:46.980 --> 00:06:48.220
Oh really?

00:06:49.210 --> 00:06:51.110
I don't care if he won.

00:06:51.110 --> 00:06:53.470
He was just lucky.

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:56.760
I'll defeat him in a single blow!

00:06:58.300 --> 00:07:02.800
Gear Golem the Moving Fortress 
attacks Morphtronic Videon.

00:07:06.270 --> 00:07:07.270
Ouch!

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:10.240
Luciano wins!

00:07:11.710 --> 00:07:13.170
Nice combo!

00:07:13.170 --> 00:07:15.150
No wonder he's a winner!

00:07:15.150 --> 00:07:16.910
He's on a different level than Lua!

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:20.120
No big whoop.

00:07:20.280 --> 00:07:22.610
Luca and Bob are next.

00:07:22.610 --> 00:07:24.530
Take their places.

00:07:24.530 --> 00:07:25.450
Okay!

00:07:26.190 --> 00:07:28.340
Luciano, well done!

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:30.170
Do your best, Luca.

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:34.960
Thanks!  Watch me duel!

00:07:35.880 --> 00:07:39.080
I'll see how a Signer duels.

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:40.570
Begin!

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:41.820
Duel!

00:07:41.820 --> 00:07:43.200
My turn!

00:07:43.200 --> 00:07:45.060
I summon Sunlight Unicorn!

00:07:46.460 --> 00:07:49.080
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:50.950
Here I go!  My turn!

00:07:54.520 --> 00:07:55.790
Luca.

00:07:56.690 --> 00:07:58.740
Luciano.

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:00.800
What's with that duel?

00:08:01.350 --> 00:08:05.830
With your skills, you could've 
defeated him in under a minute.

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:07.150
Uh, what?

00:08:07.150 --> 00:08:08.940
Are you feeling sick?

00:08:08.940 --> 00:08:12.400
Not at all.  That was my skill level.

00:08:12.400 --> 00:08:13.220
But-

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:16.770
I hope you'll teach me 
next time.  I'm in a rush.

00:08:17.460 --> 00:08:21.130
She's keeping her Signer identity a secret.

00:08:21.130 --> 00:08:23.770
In that case, I have an idea.

00:08:24.290 --> 00:08:27.230
He had perfect combos!

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:31.380
And Luciano always used his 
cards at the right time!

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:34.000
He anticipates his opponent's moves!

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:36.100
He's cool!

00:08:36.100 --> 00:08:39.330
It's rare that you praise 
someone so highly, Luca.

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:42.530
Because he's really incredible!  Right, Lua?

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:45.580
Really?  I thought he was so-so.

00:08:47.490 --> 00:08:50.980
I'm going home.  See ya.

00:08:52.710 --> 00:08:54.180
What's wrong?

00:08:54.180 --> 00:08:57.950
I think he's upset because he 
lost his duel against Luciano.

00:08:57.950 --> 00:09:00.420
Good morning.

00:09:00.420 --> 00:09:01.850
Good morning.

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:02.890
Luca.

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:05.120
Good morning.

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:06.360
Luciano.

00:09:06.840 --> 00:09:09.560
I was waiting to talk to you.

00:09:09.560 --> 00:09:11.140
With me?

00:09:11.140 --> 00:09:13.150
We don't want to talk to you.

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:15.070
Are you free after school?

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:16.640
Absolutely not.

00:09:16.640 --> 00:09:18.280
Want to come to my house?

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:20.290
I want to show you something.

00:09:20.290 --> 00:09:21.240
What is it?

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:23.000
Come and find out.

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:24.290
No!

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:26.410
We're busy after school!

00:09:26.410 --> 00:09:28.760
I was talking with Luca.

00:09:28.760 --> 00:09:30.710
Don't interfere.

00:09:30.710 --> 00:09:33.230
Luca and I are one!

00:09:33.230 --> 00:09:35.240
If I say no, then Luca also says no!

00:09:35.240 --> 00:09:36.410
Let's go, Luca!

00:09:36.410 --> 00:09:38.920
Stop pulling so hard!

00:09:39.120 --> 00:09:41.390
Sorry, Luciano!

00:09:42.090 --> 00:09:45.190
Why do you hate Luciano so much?

00:09:45.190 --> 00:09:47.080
Just because you lost against him-

00:09:47.080 --> 00:09:49.380
I don't hate him.

00:09:53.330 --> 00:09:54.540
Lua.

00:09:54.540 --> 00:09:56.240
Ms. Maria.

00:09:56.430 --> 00:09:59.540
Can you stay after school today?

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:01.210
I have a favor to ask.

00:10:01.210 --> 00:10:03.850
Oh, okay.

00:10:03.850 --> 00:10:05.240
Thank you.

00:10:14.320 --> 00:10:15.690
See you later.

00:10:15.690 --> 00:10:16.800
Bye bye.

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:25.140
Luca.

00:10:25.140 --> 00:10:29.060
Luciano?  That's an awesome car.

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:31.050
You're not with Lua?

00:10:31.050 --> 00:10:32.910
Would you like a ride?

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:34.320
But...

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:35.890
Come to my house.

00:10:35.890 --> 00:10:38.520
I told you that there's something 
I wanted to show you.

00:10:38.520 --> 00:10:40.980
Okay, in that case...

00:10:44.890 --> 00:10:46.880
It's Luca and Luciano.

00:10:46.880 --> 00:10:49.360
Were they friends?

00:10:56.220 --> 00:11:00.100
Maria is late.  What's she doing?

00:11:01.770 --> 00:11:04.010
Lua, you're still here?

00:11:04.010 --> 00:11:05.490
Teacher!

00:11:05.490 --> 00:11:08.000
Why are you still here so late?

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:10.620
That's no good!  Go home!

00:11:18.360 --> 00:11:22.360
What an incredible house!  
It's like a palace!

00:11:22.360 --> 00:11:25.590
Luciano, your family must be very rich.

00:11:25.590 --> 00:11:26.560
I guess.

00:11:27.850 --> 00:11:30.270
Well come home, young master.

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:31.890
I'm home.

00:11:31.890 --> 00:11:32.970
Hello.

00:11:32.970 --> 00:11:36.330
Placido, bring tea and snacks for my guest.

00:11:36.330 --> 00:11:37.900
As you wish.

00:11:40.590 --> 00:11:44.320
Luciano was planning to 
kidnap Luca from the start!

00:11:44.840 --> 00:11:48.420
Luca left in a car with Luciano.

00:11:49.030 --> 00:11:51.340
Want to come to my house?

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:54.790
Damn!

00:11:58.760 --> 00:12:00.760
This is the place.

00:12:00.760 --> 00:12:01.820
Okay...

00:12:06.940 --> 00:12:09.670
There's another guest.

00:12:15.530 --> 00:12:16.610
Luca?

00:12:38.870 --> 00:12:41.200
Wow, Luciano!

00:12:58.870 --> 00:13:01.030
Wow, Luciano!

00:13:03.940 --> 00:13:06.030
Luca, you try.

00:13:06.990 --> 00:13:08.780
That's impossible.

00:13:08.780 --> 00:13:12.040
It's built to match your body type.

00:13:12.040 --> 00:13:13.490
Mine?

00:13:13.490 --> 00:13:16.770
I'm giving it to you as a present.  Take it.

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:18.020
Thank you.

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:20.250
But why me?

00:13:20.250 --> 00:13:23.340
I want you to duel me on this Duel Board.

00:13:23.340 --> 00:13:26.330
A real Riding Duel.

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:28.190
Riding Duel?

00:13:28.190 --> 00:13:31.370
What does he mean by Riding Duel?

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:38.130
By inserting this cord and connecting this 
plug with Moment, it links to the Duel Disk.

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:39.330
You're right!

00:13:39.560 --> 00:13:41.060
Let's practice together.

00:13:41.060 --> 00:13:43.310
I'll teach you how to skate.

00:13:43.310 --> 00:13:44.230
Okay!

00:13:51.750 --> 00:13:53.610
Yeah, you have the hang of it!

00:13:53.610 --> 00:13:55.000
Look ahead more!

00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:57.110
Don't get distracted by your feet!

00:13:57.110 --> 00:13:59.280
Yeah, you're doing well!

00:13:59.280 --> 00:14:01.230
I brought drinks.

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:02.840
Thank you.

00:14:03.140 --> 00:14:04.880
What about the other guest?

00:14:04.880 --> 00:14:06.170
It seems he went home.

00:14:06.170 --> 00:14:08.530
Just as I expected.

00:14:10.310 --> 00:14:13.700
Sorry to treat you like a servant.

00:14:14.220 --> 00:14:16.240
There's no need to apologize.

00:14:16.240 --> 00:14:19.770
I also wanted to see a 
Signer with my own eyes.

00:14:19.770 --> 00:14:21.200
Oh yeah.

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:24.930
A Duel Board?

00:14:24.930 --> 00:14:25.610
Yeah.

00:14:25.820 --> 00:14:31.580
The vehicle looks like this, and 
it connects to a Duel Disk here.

00:14:31.580 --> 00:14:32.830
I see.

00:14:32.830 --> 00:14:35.590
He can easily have Riding Duels.

00:14:35.590 --> 00:14:37.430
What a clever concept.

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:39.060
Yusei, what do you think?

00:14:39.220 --> 00:14:44.830
Since it's a simple idea, I can 
build it with leftover parts, but...

00:14:44.830 --> 00:14:47.940
I really want to defeat Luciano!

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:50.360
I want to beat and outsmart him!

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:52.000
Yusei, will you do it?

00:14:52.190 --> 00:14:54.330
Will you?

00:14:54.330 --> 00:14:56.010
I guess so.

00:14:58.030 --> 00:14:59.830
Thanks for today.

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:02.200
I'll wait for you again tomorrow.

00:15:02.200 --> 00:15:03.110
Okay.

00:15:03.110 --> 00:15:05.880
Oh, can I bring Lua tomorrow?

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:06.950
Lua?

00:15:06.950 --> 00:15:07.640
Yeah.

00:15:07.640 --> 00:15:13.590
Lua always wanted to have a Riding 
Duel, so I think he'll be very happy!

00:15:13.590 --> 00:15:15.950
Of course he's welcome.

00:15:15.950 --> 00:15:17.060
See you.

00:15:17.420 --> 00:15:18.880
Bye!

00:15:23.590 --> 00:15:25.420
I'm home!

00:15:25.420 --> 00:15:26.780
Lua?

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:28.000
Lua?

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:33.480
He's not home yet?

00:15:54.340 --> 00:15:55.570
Lua?

00:15:56.290 --> 00:15:58.510
He didn't come home?

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:32.720
Damn!

00:16:35.070 --> 00:16:37.070
I won't lose!

00:16:47.810 --> 00:16:49.270
Damn!

00:16:53.820 --> 00:16:54.820
Luca!

00:16:56.250 --> 00:16:59.130
Luca, why are you here?

00:16:59.550 --> 00:17:01.430
I talked to Yusei.

00:17:01.430 --> 00:17:03.430
He said you were here.

00:17:03.960 --> 00:17:06.870
You don't have to go to Luciano's house?

00:17:07.440 --> 00:17:10.830
Because you want to defeat Luciano, right?

00:17:11.410 --> 00:17:13.410
I'll root for you!

00:17:13.410 --> 00:17:15.150
Let's practice together.

00:17:15.820 --> 00:17:17.080
Yeah!

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:20.330
You've got it!  Keep it up, Lua!

00:17:20.330 --> 00:17:22.320
Luca, you're doing well too!

00:17:30.460 --> 00:17:32.160
Who's that?

00:17:42.810 --> 00:17:44.510
Lua!

00:17:44.510 --> 00:17:46.170
I have no business with him!

00:17:46.170 --> 00:17:48.160
I have business with you!

00:17:48.650 --> 00:17:51.400
You're going to duel.

00:17:55.950 --> 00:17:57.100
What?

00:17:58.150 --> 00:17:59.360
No way!

00:17:59.510 --> 00:18:02.580
The Duel Board is moving on its own!

00:18:02.780 --> 00:18:04.030
Come with me!

00:18:04.030 --> 00:18:04.960
Lua!

00:18:04.960 --> 00:18:06.200
Luca!

00:18:06.400 --> 00:18:08.210
Wait up!

00:18:08.210 --> 00:18:10.630
I'll be your opponent!

00:18:11.470 --> 00:18:12.640
Interesting!

00:18:12.640 --> 00:18:15.010
I'll defeat you both!

00:18:15.500 --> 00:18:18.310
The Field Spell Speed World 2!

00:18:18.310 --> 00:18:19.540
Set on!

00:18:24.180 --> 00:18:27.150
A duel is starting.

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:29.420
Lane selection...

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:32.130
Searching for optimal lane...

00:18:32.130 --> 00:18:34.960
Sending duel lane request to Central.

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:36.390
Authorization!

00:18:36.870 --> 00:18:38.400
What should we do, Lua?

00:18:38.400 --> 00:18:40.910
I've never had a Riding Duel before!

00:18:40.910 --> 00:18:43.750
Don't worry.  I'll protect you!

00:18:43.750 --> 00:18:45.120
We'll win!

00:18:45.120 --> 00:18:47.930
Just like when we defeated Demak together!

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:53.210
Riding Duel!

00:18:53.410 --> 00:18:55.210
Acceleration!

00:18:55.590 --> 00:18:58.250
You start!  Bring it!

00:18:58.250 --> 00:18:59.380
My turn!

00:19:00.850 --> 00:19:03.890
I summon Bird of Roses and end my turn!

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:08.520
1800 attack points?

00:19:09.380 --> 00:19:10.620
My turn!

00:19:13.030 --> 00:19:16.200
I summon Absurd Stealer from my hand!

00:19:17.660 --> 00:19:22.370
When this card is successfully summoned, 
your monster's attack points become 0.

00:19:22.580 --> 00:19:26.640
My monster's attack points are equal to your 
monster's defense points until the End Phase!

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:29.500
Absurd Stealer attacks Bird of Roses!

00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:30.960
Absurd Return!

00:19:35.950 --> 00:19:37.190
Luca!

00:19:42.930 --> 00:19:44.870
Thank you, Regulus.

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:47.290
Did you like that?

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:51.310
When your life points take damage 
in this duel, you feel it for real.

00:19:51.310 --> 00:19:52.610
For real?

00:19:57.060 --> 00:19:58.500
The mark...

00:19:58.830 --> 00:20:00.180
Luca...

00:20:00.180 --> 00:20:02.150
I activate my monster's effect!

00:20:02.150 --> 00:20:05.150
When Bird of Roses is destroyed in battle,

00:20:05.150 --> 00:20:09.100
I can Special Summon two Plant-Type 
Tuner Monsters from my deck!

00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:13.290
I Special Summon the Tuner Monsters 
Nettles and Spore in defense position!

00:20:13.290 --> 00:20:16.590
I set three cards and end my turn.

00:20:17.760 --> 00:20:19.520
How dare you try to hurt Luca!

00:20:19.520 --> 00:20:22.100
I won't let you attack Luca anymore!

00:20:22.100 --> 00:20:24.710
I'll defeat you!  My turn!

00:20:27.030 --> 00:20:30.130
I summon Morphtronic Datatron from my hand!

00:20:30.570 --> 00:20:33.270
Datatron attacks Absurd Stealer!

00:20:33.270 --> 00:20:34.580
Chakan Fire!

00:20:34.580 --> 00:20:35.790
I got you.

00:20:36.030 --> 00:20:38.940
I activate my trap Exus Summon!

00:20:38.940 --> 00:20:41.830
The monster that's being 
attacked returns to my hand.

00:20:41.830 --> 00:20:46.360
Then I Special Summon a monster with 
fewer attack points in attack position!

00:20:46.360 --> 00:20:48.920
I Special Summon Sky Core!

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:54.800
0 attack points?

00:20:54.800 --> 00:20:56.470
Then I activate a trap!

00:20:56.470 --> 00:20:57.880
Torrential Tribute!

00:20:57.880 --> 00:21:02.670
When a monster is summoned, all 
monsters on the field are destroyed!

00:21:02.670 --> 00:21:04.690
Even his own monster?

00:21:07.600 --> 00:21:14.220
When a card effect destroys Sky Core, 
all monsters on my field are destroyed.

00:21:14.220 --> 00:21:18.520
Then from my deck, hand or graveyard, I can 
Special Summon Meklord Emperor Skiel...

00:21:18.690 --> 00:21:20.760
Skiel Top...

00:21:20.760 --> 00:21:23.060
Skiel Attack...

00:21:23.060 --> 00:21:25.300
Skiel Guard...

00:21:25.300 --> 00:21:28.170
and Skiel Carrier!

00:21:28.650 --> 00:21:31.000
He summoned five monsters at once!

00:21:31.000 --> 00:21:34.210
I activate Meklord Emperor Skiel's effect!

00:21:44.480 --> 00:21:47.140
What's this giant robot?

00:22:09.860 --> 00:22:14.540
The small cliff floats on the Milky Way

00:22:14.540 --> 00:22:19.550
The sights I see are different 
than what I imagined

00:22:19.830 --> 00:22:24.450
Were you able to move on from the past?

00:22:24.450 --> 00:22:29.460
The answer isn't no, but 
there's something missing

00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:34.330
The cruel god tests us

00:22:34.630 --> 00:22:41.270
Let's fill the emptiness 
and head to the next stage

00:22:41.270 --> 00:22:45.140
If you ask me "What's our relationship?"

00:22:45.140 --> 00:22:51.010
We're more than friends... 
but that's not quite right

00:22:51.180 --> 00:22:54.930
Bond is the proper word

00:22:54.930 --> 00:23:00.910
As we fight, we understand each other

00:23:00.910 --> 00:23:03.880
"Where are you right now?"  "On Earth"

00:23:03.880 --> 00:23:06.110
Because I'm not an astronaut

00:23:06.110 --> 00:23:10.790
I have no problems when 
I'm below the ozone layer

00:23:11.080 --> 00:23:13.650
"I know, I'm coming right away."

00:23:13.650 --> 00:23:17.120
You want to party until the morning

00:23:17.120 --> 00:23:20.360
At our special place
